{"id":"7551aee33af1c14c","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-left-ce-prefix-presentation.md","title":"Prefix-Free Presentations of Left-c.e. Reals","display":"thm-left-ce-prefix-presentation — Prefix-Free Presentations of Left-c.e. Reals","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-left-ce-prefix-presentation","aliases":["43-thm-left-ce-prefix-presentation"],"display":"thm-left-ce-prefix-presentation — Prefix-Free Presentations of Left-c.e. Reals","depends_on":["[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-prefixfree]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 8.1.4(iii)–(iv)","source_printed_pages":"134–135","source_pdf_pages":"154–155","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-left-ce-prefix-presentation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-left-ce-prefix-presentation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-left-ce-prefix-presentation — Prefix-Free Presentations of Left-c.e. Reals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7071caa967351d5\" href=\"?note=e7071caa967351d5\" title=\"43-df-prefixfree\">43-df-prefixfree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 8.1.4(iii)–(iv)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"134–135"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"154–155"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\alpha\\in[0,1]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrefixFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrefixFree}\\)</span> 采用相应定义，串集合经固定有效编码解释。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e7071caa967351d5\" href=\"?note=e7071caa967351d5\" title=\"43-df-prefixfree\">43-df-prefixfree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CE}(S)\\land\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(S)\\land\\alpha=\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CE}(S)\\land\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(S)\\land\\alpha=\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只取来源中稳健的 c.e. 前缀表示等价，不沿用草稿 (v) 周边关于可计算表示的混乱编号。由递增二进有理增量提出 KC 请求即可得到表示。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 8.1.4(iii)–(iv)；印刷页 134–135，PDF 页 154–155。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixfree","status":"resolved","id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixfree]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-prefixfree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-prefixfree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixfree","status":"resolved","id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-prefixfree]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrefixFree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CE}(S)\\land\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(S)\\land\\alpha=\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1689,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-left-ce-prefix-presentation]] — Prefix-Free Presentations of Left-c.e. Reals"}],"outgoing":["e7d00f16a112ff92","6c0559518cd32104","e7071caa967351d5"]}